; Galton-Watson surname survival: a man has 0 sons (1/4), 1 son (1/2), or 2 sons (1/4).
; Almost-Sure Termination -> the family line dies out almost-surely.
; Expected: WORST_CASE(Non-SAST,AST). Class: Ground, Non-overlapping, Tail-recursive.

(format PTRS)

(fun person 0) (fun extinct 0) (fun one 1) (fun two 2)

(prule person ((extinct :prob 1) ((one person) :prob 2) ((two person person) :prob 1)))
